<img width="1279" alt="Screenshot 2020-01-01 at 22 11 03" src="https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/13942717/71646252-880e6880-2ce5-11ea-8fdd-dfaea23e2ca6.png">


Fixes #9897

- Update next version to 9.2.0;
- Removed cssnano since it will be [minified](https://nextjs.org/docs/basic-features/built-in-css-support#adding-a-global-stylesheet) automatically in production;
- Update regex from tailwind docs [controlling file size](https://tailwindcss.com/docs/controlling-file-size#understanding-the-regex);
- Update other dependencies version in `package.json`;
- Fix css -> CSS.

When users download the example [with-typescript-graphql](https://github.com/zeit/next.js/blob/canary/examples/with-typescript-graphql/README.md#graphql-and-typescript-example), they'll see the following error:

```
4:12 Parameter '_parent' implicitly has an 'any' type.
    2 | const resolvers = {
    3 |   Query: {
  > 4 |     viewer(_parent, _args, _context, _info) {
      |            ^
    5 |       return { id: 1, name: 'John Smith', status: 'cached' }
    6 |     },
    7 |   },
```

It lacks typing. Let me please add it.
